---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Acknowledgments" description="With gratitude to the mentors, clients, family, and friends who made the work possible.">

  <section class="container py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl animate-in">
      <a href="/about/teachers" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors mb-8">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
        </svg>
        My Teachers
      </a>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Acknowledgments</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary">
        With gratitude
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 max-w-3xl space-y-10">

      <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-lg">
        To my early mentors from Deloitte in Toronto: John Gambles, P. Howard Lyons, Jim Youldon, Rayanne Webster, Denman Lawrenson, and Sid Himmel, and to Alan Slaight.
      </p>

      <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-lg">
        To countless clients through 30 years of consulting that taught me their businesses and allowed me to contribute to their success.
      </p>

      <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-lg">
        To my parents, Colin "Bill" Dimon, and Gwen Dimon.
      </p>

      <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-lg">
        To my siblings, Bob, Rick, Neil & Marlene.
      </p>

      <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-lg">
        Also to Rohit Millstein, Marty Kaplan, and Bonny Smith, Kevin Hunter, Brian Ginsberg, Bill Fowkes, Carl Tsenis, Corrado Fermo, Dick Antalek, Barbara Paige Kaplan, Madelyn Reid, Charlotte Reid, Patricia Sagara, Ed Majors, Gebhard Rainer, Mark Macaluso, Grace Stubberfield, Roland Edwards, and to my children, Harrison Dimon, Heather St. Hilaire, and Ruth Dimon.
      </p>

      <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-lg">
        To my grandchildren, Emilie & Chloe.
      </p>

      <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-lg italic">
        And finally, to my wife and illustrator, Meredith Dimon, thank you for your love, encouragement, and inspiration.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

</Page>
